# Unrestricted Be 1s2 2s2 with equal alpha and beta orbitals: the
# first-order SCF converges to the spin-symmetric saddle point, whose
# triplet instability the spin-symmetric gradient does not touch. The
# trust-region solver fails there; following the unstable mode down
# reaches the broken-symmetry minimum 0.27 mEh below.
System Be.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
Method HF
Multiplicity 1
Restricted false
ComplexBasis true
LinearOccupations -1
LinearOccupationFile complex_orbs_be_hf_saddle.linocc
LinearB 0.0
JKMethod Cholesky
TrustRegion true
SaveChk complex_orbs_be_hf_saddle.chk
